A
1000
ACF_SOUNDS
# SGES Canon sounds
# This needs to be call Master Bank to work in X-Plane 12, but the GUID must be different than other MAster banks used by other objects. To do so, avoid starting from an existing project to create a new sound bank, or create a new Bank, move every FMOD events in it, then rename it Master Bank, to force FMOD to distribute it with a different GUI !

DISABLE_LEGACY_ALERT_SOUNDS


BEGIN_SOUND_ATTACHMENT
	EVENT_NAME /Canons1
	EVENT_ALLOWED_FOR_AI
	VEH_XYZ 0 0 0
	EVENT_START_COND sim/graphics/view/view_elevation_agl_mtrs[*] <= 4000
	EVENT_END_COND sim/graphics/view/view_elevation_agl_mtrs[*] > 4000
END_SOUND_ATTACHMENT

BEGIN_SOUND_ATTACHMENT
	EVENT_NAME /Bullet
	EVENT_ALLOWED_FOR_AI
	VEH_XYZ 0 1000 0
	EVENT_START_COND sim/graphics/view/view_elevation_agl_mtrs[*] <= 1200
	EVENT_END_COND sim/graphics/view/view_elevation_agl_mtrs[*] > 1200
END_SOUND_ATTACHMENT
